---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10rulemap">
  <div class="sbp10rulemap-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 358" role="img" aria-label="Table linking each rule of the first-year plan to the post of the series where it is explained, from Post 2 to Post 9.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Where each rule of the plan comes from</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi quy tắc của kế hoạch đến từ đâu</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="48" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="69" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 2</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="69" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Venues and account</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sàn và tài khoản</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="69"><tspan data-lang-en>Buy in 100-share lots; price moves at most 7% a day on HOSE</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua theo lô 100; giá biến động tối đa 7% mỗi ngày trên HOSE</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="86" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="107" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 3</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="107" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Order types</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Loại lệnh</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="107"><tspan data-lang-en>Use limit orders at a set price, not market orders</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng lệnh giới hạn ở giá định trước, không dùng lệnh thị trường</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="124" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="145" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 4</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="145" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Fees, tax, T+2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phí, thuế, T+2</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="145"><tspan data-lang-en>Count 0.4% per round trip; sale money lands on T+2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tính 0,4% mỗi vòng; tiền bán về sau T+2</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="162" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="183" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 5</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="183" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Dividends</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ tức</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="183"><tspan data-lang-en>A dividend lowers the price on the ex-date; it is not a gain on top</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ tức làm giảm giá ngày GDKHQ; không phải lãi cộng thêm</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="200" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="221" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 6</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 6</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="221" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Financial statements</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Báo cáo tài chính</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="221"><tspan data-lang-en>Sell rule 1: profit, cash flow and audit opinion</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quy tắc bán 1: lợi nhuận, dòng tiền, ý kiến kiểm toán</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="238" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="259" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 7</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 7</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="259" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Valuation</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Định giá</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="259"><tspan data-lang-en>Do not buy a cyclical because its P/E looks low at the peak</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không mua cổ phiếu chu kỳ chỉ vì P/E thấp ở đỉnh</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="276" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="297" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 8</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 8</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="297" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Rates and cycles</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi suất và chu kỳ</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="297"><tspan data-lang-en>Review sector exposure each quarter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rà tỷ trọng ngành mỗi quý</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="314" width="860" height="32" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="34" y="335" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Post 9</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 9</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="335" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Margin and psychology</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Margin và tâm lý</tspan></text>
      <text x="290" y="335"><tspan data-lang-en>No margin in year one; write rules before the price moves</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không vay margin năm đầu; viết quy tắc trước khi giá chạy</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The plan has no new theory. Each line is a mechanic from an earlier post turned into a rule you can check.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Kế hoạch không có lý thuyết mới. Mỗi dòng là một cơ chế từ bài trước, đổi thành quy tắc bạn kiểm tra được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10rulemap { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10rulemap-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10rulemap svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10rulemap text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10rulemap .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10rulemap .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10rulemap .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10rulemap .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10rulemap .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10rulemap .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10rulemap .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10rulemap .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10rulemap .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10rulemap .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10rulemap .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10rulemap .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10rulemap .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10rulemap .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10rulemap .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10rulemap .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10rulemap .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10rulemap .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10rulemap .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10rulemap .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10rulemap .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10rulemap .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10rulemap .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10rulemap .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10rulemap figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
